  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "美國文學",
    "sub_ename": "AMERICAN LITERATURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程涵蓋美國主要文學作品，本課程介紹一系列的重要文學概念，包括美國夢、區域文學、拓荒、地方色彩、美國寫實主義、現代主義及後現代主義。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed as a survey course covering major topics over four-hundred years of American literary history. Besides introducing major authors, featured works, historical heritage, etc., we will also help students comprehend the following key literary movements: Realism, Naturalism, Modernism, and Postmodernism etc.",
